                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为进一步加强中学生思想政治引领和价值引领，积极培育和践行社会主义核心价值观，弘扬宪法精神，促使高三学生树立远大理想、提高成人意识，我校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在4月3日开展2025届</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">18岁成人仪式</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，勉励学生胸怀理想、懂得感恩、知法守法、勇担责任、努力拼搏、决胜高考。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成人仪式在学校锡麟体育馆举行</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校领导班子、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三全体</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">老师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和家长代表</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">到场参加</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，共同见证了高三700余名学子的成人时刻。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 0.33in;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奏唱国歌</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">】</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">国旗护卫队</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【领导致辞】</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">书记、校长</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋明</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">向高三学子提出三点希望：一是希望高三学子以学增智，用智慧充实头脑；二是希望高三学子以行致远，用脚步丈量青春；三是希望高三学子以梦引路，用理想指明方向。成人礼的钟声尚未远去，而高考倒计时的战鼓已然擂响，在接下来的日子里，希望</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三学子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">既要汲取书本里的智慧，也要提炼实践中的经验，心中有梦，眼中有光，脚下有路，乘风破浪，成人成才。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【师长寄语】</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三教</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">代表谢澹老师用写过的三个作文题向高三学子寄语：希望高三学子既有继承的谦卑，也有破茧的实力，让代际的温情与理性的锋芒共存；祝福高三学子一生没有风雨，但更期待能拥有对抗风雨的底气；希望高三学子能找到自己的真正热爱，并在热爱中享受人生奋斗的乐趣。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【父母祝福】</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">十八年的风雨历程，是父母陪伴着我们一起走过，生活中的点点滴滴，是父母为我们无私奉献</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。成人仪式现场高三</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">家长代表302班沈凡想妈妈、306班周泽震妈妈、311班朱浩川爸爸</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过读信的方式为高三学子送上了珍贵的成人祝福。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生发言</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">】</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">（插入图片）</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生代表</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">307班滕杰同学上台发言。他谈到，十八岁不仅仅是一个年龄的跨越，更是一份责任与担当的开始。十八年来，我们承载了太多的关爱和呵护，要感谢父母的辛勤付出，老师的谆谆教诲，朋友的真诚陪伴。不负韶华，不负期望，勇敢追梦，砥砺前行！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">青春希冀</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">】</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">成人仪式现场</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">播放</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了高三</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各班学生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">集体</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">录制的青春视频</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【庄严授礼】</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">18岁不仅是年龄的刻度，更意味着责任的觉醒。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在场的老师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">和家长</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">代表为高三各班同学戴上成人帽，颁发《宪法》。今天，戴上成人帽，手持</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">红彤彤的《宪法》，高三学子将</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">肩负起成人的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">责任</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">与</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">担当</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，奔赴新的征程</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【铮铮誓言】</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">滕杰</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">带领全体学生进行成人宣誓。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">走成人门</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">】</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">跨越成人门，开启新征程。这一刻，是告别，亦是启程。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">【</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">定格青春</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">】</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全体同学喊口号、抛帽，各班</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">集体</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">合影留念。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">十八而志，青春万岁。18岁要绽开生命最灿烂的微笑，18岁将奏响人生最美妙的旋律！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 22.0pt;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/4/202504090906460839.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202504090906460839.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/4/202504090906461063.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202504090906461063.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/4/202504090906460576.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202504090906460576.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/4/202504090906467127.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202504090906467127.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/4/202504090906466039.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202504090906466039.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/4/202504090906469454.jpg" sty